Article 35 Where, in violation of these Regulations, the relevant departments of the people's governments at or above the county level commit any of the following acts, the persons in charge with responsibility and other directly liable persons shall be given sanctions according to law; if a crime is constituted, criminal liability shall be investigated according to law:
(1) issuing a construction project planning permit for a civil building project whose design scheme does not conform to the mandatory standards for energy conservation in civil buildings;
(2) issuing a qualified opinion on a design scheme that does not conform to the mandatory standards for energy conservation in civil buildings;
(3) issuing a construction permit for a civil building project whose construction drawing design documents do not conform to the mandatory standards for energy conservation in civil buildings;
(4) other acts of failing to perform the duties of supervision and administration according to law.

Article 37 Where, in violation of these Regulations, a construction entity commits any of the following acts, the competent department of construction under the local people's government at or above the county level shall order it to make corrections and impose a fine of not less than 200,000 yuan but not more than 500,000 yuan:
(1) expressly or impliedly instructing the design entity or construction entity to design or construct in violation of the mandatory standards for energy conservation in civil buildings;
(2) expressly or impliedly instructing the construction entity to use wall materials, thermal insulation materials, doors and windows, heating and air conditioning systems, or lighting equipment that do not meet the requirements of the construction drawing design documents;
(3) procuring wall materials, thermal insulation materials, doors and windows, heating and air conditioning systems, or lighting equipment that do not meet the requirements of the construction drawing design documents;
(4) using technologies, processes, materials or equipment listed in the directory of prohibited use.

Article 41 Where, in violation of these Regulations, a construction entity commits any of the following acts, the competent department of construction under the local people's government at or above the county level shall order it to make corrections and impose a fine of not less than 100,000 yuan but not more than 200,000 yuan; if the circumstances are serious, the department that issued the qualification certificate shall order it to suspend operations for rectification, lower its qualification grade, or revoke the qualification certificate; if losses are caused, it shall bear compensation liability according to law:
(1) failing to inspect wall materials, thermal insulation materials, doors and windows, heating and air conditioning systems, or lighting equipment entering the construction site;
(2) using wall materials, thermal insulation materials, doors and windows, heating and air conditioning systems, or lighting equipment that do not meet the requirements of the construction drawing design documents;
(3) using technologies, processes, materials or equipment listed in the directory of prohibited use.
